{"agent":"psw-kilo","data":{"budget":"","claim":"Only a failed gate outcome is proof the family got the work wrong; partial and unavailable never count (the tool could not run). Two failed leases of one family on one item make that item route to another family; the same family stays welcome on a different item.","falsifier":"If partial/unavailable counted, a family whose reviewers were merely missing would be barred from work it never failed. If the mark were per family, a two-for-two family would be barred everywhere.","item":"SW-reassign","mechanism":"Fold the event log once (metrics.facts.collect); credit each failed gate outcome to the family of the lease that held the item across it (ledger._author_model); two such failures poison that family for that item only.","probe":"uv run pytest tests/test_swarm_reassign.py","probe_output":"test_two_failed_leases_of_one_family_poison_it_for_that_item and test_a_partial_or_unavailable_outcome_is_not_a_failed_lease pass: route(['moonshot','alibaba'])==['alibaba'] and partial+unavailable never reach the mark of two","question":"Which gate outcomes mark a family poisoned for an item, and is poison per item or per family?","sources":[],"verdict":"CONFIRMED"},"id":"e486351b61818248971b79f6d","kind":"research.recorded","lamport":170113,"schema":1,"subject":"Ra3627ca8c4","ts":"2026-11-11T04:55:00.598149Z"}
