{"agent":"psw-kilo","data":{"digest":"ac32aebfd9e7dd76","finding":1,"gate":"rubber_duck","location":"ddflow/services/swarm/reassign.py:96","probe":"the [at, nxt) window is deliberately half-open: a gate outcome at nxt is the NEXT claim's first act (or a gate that 'failed' stamped exactly at the completion ts, which a real log never holds because a gate outcome precedes item.completed). For every next claim at t2>at the failed gate at t2 belongs to that next claim, so this claim must NOT charge it; a degenerate o.at==completed log is not a lease that failed while it held the item.","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/swarm/reassign.py:96","verdict":"refuted"},"id":"e75951afb50d08f541234be3f","kind":"review.triaged","lamport":170159,"schema":1,"subject":"SW-reassign","ts":"2026-11-11T04:59:57.884659Z"}
